        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 2 The SECC received the relevant contract certificate in the AuthorizationReq. The SECC accepted this contract certificate as an authorization method when it sent the AuthorizationRes for this AuthorizationReq with the ResponseCode starting with \"OK\".",
