        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 3 The SECC can submit the contract certificate to a secondary actor along with the signed SignedMeteringData, so that the secondary actor can later re-verify it. In case the secondary actor has stored the contract certificate already, an ID and the issuing CA for the contract certificate can suffice.",
            "block_bbox": [
